bind Report Animal Abuse: Abuse Severity, Animal Species, Animal Age
bind Investigate Abuse Report: Abuse Severity
bind Rescue Abused Animal: Animal Species, Animal Age, Animal Health
bind Provide Veterinary Care: Animal Health
bind Find Foster Home: Animal Health, Shelter Capacity
